{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-ssh-pro#feature-1","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-ssh-pro","commit":"d3785e4c8a77c9e59156a68f8794af35e24ff6e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-pro 的功能「SSH 连通性测试」：工具 ssh_test 使用主机别名连接服务器并执行 true，返回成功状态、延迟或错误信息。调用时提供已配置的别名，也可覆盖连接超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:168-189"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-ssh-pro#feature-2","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-ssh-pro","commit":"d3785e4c8a77c9e59156a68f8794af35e24ff6e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-pro 的功能「远程目录浏览」：工具 ssh_ls 通过 SFTP 列出指定主机目录，输出文件名、类型、大小和修改时间。传入主机别名与路径；路径缺省时列出远程当前用户的 home 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:193-228"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-ssh-pro#feature-3","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-ssh-pro","commit":"d3785e4c8a77c9e59156a68f8794af35e24ff6e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-pro 的功能「导入 SSH 主机」：ssh_import 解析本机 ~/.ssh/config 的主机、用户、端口、密钥路径和跳板项，将新主机合并写入存储，并跳过已存在或通配符条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:232-292"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-ssh-pro#feature-4","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-ssh-pro","commit":"d3785e4c8a77c9e59156a68f8794af35e24ff6e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-pro 的功能「多主机命令执行」：工具 ssh_multi_exec 对筛选出的多台主机并发执行同一条命令，并汇总每台机器的状态、退出码、错误和部分标准输出。可按别名、环境或标签过滤，也可设定并发数与单机超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:323-357"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-ssh-pro#feature-5","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-ssh-pro","commit":"d3785e4c8a77c9e59156a68f8794af35e24ff6e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-pro 的功能「known_hosts 查询」：工具 ssh_keyscan 根据主机别名或地址，在本机 known_hosts 文件中检查是否存在匹配条目，并返回已记录或尚未记录的状态。可提供端口，默认使用 22。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:296-319"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-ssh-pro#caveat-1","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-ssh-pro","commit":"d3785e4c8a77c9e59156a68f8794af35e24ff6e0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-pro 使用前须知：ssh_import 会将导入的主机配置写入本地主机存储文件，默认位置为 ~/.dsh/dsh-ssh.json（见 src/index.js:280-289）。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:280-289"]}
